00:09:06.078 --> 00:09:11.458
The channel is an amorphous oxide semiconductor, laid down cold enough that the copper underneath

00:09:11.458 --> 00:09:14.398
never sees a process above 400 degrees Celsius.

00:09:15.138 --> 00:09:17.898
Ordinary silicon transistors leak when they are off.

00:09:18.458 --> 00:09:23.258
The oxide channel's off-current is low enough in the foundry presentation that article carries

00:09:23.258 --> 00:09:25.698
