00:09:26.218 --> 00:09:30.698
That is what lets a capacitor hold charge without a 6 transistor latch standing over it.

00:09:31.198 --> 00:09:33.398
Those 6 transistors are the SRAM bit.

00:09:33.958 --> 00:09:37.738
Six devices per bit is why cash eats area that could have been arithmetic.

00:09:38.338 --> 00:09:44.058
